<BaseLayout title="About" description="About the editorial purpose and independence of Western Tokyo Walks.">
  <article class="page-shell prose standalone-page">
    <h1>About Western Tokyo Walks</h1>
    <p>Western Tokyo Walks is an English-language site for independent travellers interested in the places beyond central Tokyo. It focuses on walking, local history and cultural landscapes, with practical travel planning where it helps readers make informed choices.</p>
    <p>Editorial independence matters here. Some future articles may contain affiliate links, but subjects and conclusions will not be shaped to fit affiliate products. Editorial articles will not be required to carry commercial recommendations.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
